"P2328232810" "You retreived the Key of Destruction from the Malta Group, and found out who was advising Malta's operaions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_TFF_Compound5.1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2517086185" "Speak with Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1397805784" "I have opened the way, and in dreams I have warned a mystic of your world of the danger, and of the vital need of her aid. Speak with Azuria, and she will have ready for you the locations of the three remaining keys. It will be up to your might to wrest them from the Circle's grasp."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1628745651" "{TaskForceName} must perish!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4072516042" "You would be the ones working as {TaskForceName} now, right? I knew you were coming. I was told in a dream by the being called Faathim the Kind that you would be coming, and that I should help you. Faathim explained what was at stake. <br><br> From what you saw, it looks like the Cirlce of Thorns used the Malta group to take two of these 'keys', by possesing one or more of their scientists. Now we just need to find this last key, but I think I have good news. Peter Steimitz just called to tell me that he felt the Circle preparing some great ritual deep in Oranbega. And Dr. Cheng has confirmed the location, so I think it's a good bet. I'll give you the location. Good luck. <br><br>Sometimes even I get surprised by the things I forsee or the entities that seek me out. I believe that this Faathim you're working with may not be telling the full truth. If the power of Rularuu is as great as I fear, then Faathim may be hiding just how dangerous this situation actually is. <br><br>But I can not imagine why."

