"P2304023729" "I stand at the center of the storm, and I shall smash this world asunder!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - LanaruTMad 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4206616353" "Defeat Lanaru The Mad"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1376142511" "You feel the tempest of energy shift with the destruction of Lanaru the Mad"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3835417079" "You have defeated Lanaru the Mad within the Storm Palace"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P803734475" "I greet you as Faathim, called Faathim the Kind. Lanaru has fallen before you, and I feel sorrow. Though he was mad and violent, he was as my brother, and as myself. He will re-form... <br>He will return in strength... <br>For he is of Rularuu. <br>And while Rularuu is, we are, forever. <br><br>But do not despair. Through your actions the threat is gone for now, and the peoples of the shard can live, and the Ravager is kept from us. <br><br>Lanaru rose up once and broke the world, and in so doing he made this place safe for a time. Soon Rularuu's power may return, but it is my hope that might like yours will be ready to face the Ravager should he come again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P1372583269" "I heard that {TaskForceName} did something big in the farthest reaches of the Shadow Shard."
